# "Target creature gains deathtouch and lifelink until end of turn. Investigate." Bot1 casts it ({B}, Mox Jet) on its own Memnite,
# not an opponent's: the Memnite (1/1) gains both keywords and its controller makes a Clue; the keywords are gone again once the
# turn ends. Bot2's Grizzly Bears is another legal target of the same spell (any creature), and Bot1 is the one who investigates, not
# the creature's controller: cast again on turn 3 at Bot2's Bears, Bot1 makes a second Clue and Bot2 none.

